// Granted by Heroes/Brute's JuggernautLandingRootSkillAction onto the owner - a parallel
// alternative to JuggernautLandingImpactUpgrade (Stun): while present, JuggernautSkillData.Discharge
// bakes a copy of Damage/RootChance/RootDuration directly onto every enemy it successfully launches
// (see JuggernautLaunched's RootDamage/RootChance/RootDuration fields), so
// JuggernautLandingImpactSystem can roll Root the same way it already rolls Stun. Independent of
// JuggernautLandingImpactUpgrade - both can be equipped at once, or just one, whichever is picked.
//
// Begin-only, deliberately not paired with End - same reasoning as every other "configures what the
// skill does" upgrade this session: re-granting fresh (idempotent) every activation and never
// removing it means it's simply always there once picked, with nothing to race against.
component JuggernautLandingRootUpgrade
{
    FP Damage;
    FP RootChance;
    FP RootDuration;
}
